[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 34981.63, "timestamp": "09:43:01", "text": "很長"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 34984.35, "timestamp": "09:43:04", "text": "。我感覺《霍格華茲》不會很長。是的，那個解謎遊戲。我還有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 34993.23, "timestamp": "09:43:13", "text": "好多"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 34995.47, "timestamp": "09:43:15", "text": "遊戲要通關。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 35000.95, "timestamp": "09:43:20", "text": "我心想，不，其實我忘了……喔不，把它刪掉會把它從"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 35007.31, "timestamp": "09:43:27", "text": "播放清單裡刪掉……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 35012.07, "timestamp": "09:43:32", "text": "喔等等，它還在。哦，沒事了。我的錯。沒事了。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 35020.47, "timestamp": "09:43:40", "text": "當時想……哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 35023.51, "timestamp": "09:43:43", "text": "天哪。哦。你想看看我在幹嘛嗎？"}]